00:01:58.038 --> 00:01:59.838
ANYBODY THAT EXPECTS BALANCE,

00:01:59.839 --> 00:02:00.839
FAIRNESS OR NUANCE IS LOOKING

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:04.276
